msgstr "Chagua saraka"

msgid "Choose the action to perform when the box is in deep standby and the automatic EPG update should normally start."
msgstr "Chagua kitendo cha kutekeleza wakati kisanduku kiko katika hali ya kusubiri ya kina na usasishaji wa kiotomatiki wa EPG unapaswa kuanza kwa kawaida."

msgid "Clear"
