msgid "Days Profile"
msgstr "Wasifu wa Siku"

msgid "Define the number of days that you want to get the full EPG data, reducing this number can help you to save memory usage on your box. But you are also limited with the EPG provider available data. You will not have 15 days EPG if it only provide 7 days data."
msgstr "Bainisha idadi ya siku ambazo ungependa kupata data kamili ya EPG, kupunguza nambari hii kunaweza kukusaidia kuhifadhi matumizi ya kumbukumbu kwenye kisanduku chako. Lakini pia una kikomo na data inayopatikana ya mtoaji wa EPG. Hutakuwa na EPG ya siku 15 ikiwa itatoa data ya siku 7 pekee."

msgid "Delete all"
msgstr "Futa zote"

msgid "Delete current EPG before import"
msgstr "Futa EPG ya sasa kabla ya kuagiza"

msgid "Delete selected"
msgstr "Futa iliyochaguliwa"

#, fuzzy
